<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Login & Signup | VisaMaster</title>

    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/auth-coming-soon.css" />
  </head>

  <body>
    <main class="coming-soon-container">
      <a href="/" class="back-home"> ← Back to Home </a>

      <div class="coming-soon-card">
        <div class="coming-soon-icon">
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="48"
            height="48"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.5"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"></circle>
            <path d="M5 21v-2a7 7 0 0 1 14 0v2"></path>
            <path d="M19 8h4"></path>
            <path d="M21 6v4"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <span class="coming-soon-label"> COMING SOON </span>

        <h1>
          Your VisaMaster Account
          <span>Is Almost Here!</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="coming-soon-description">
          We're working on something exciting! Soon, you'll be able to create
          your account, manage visa applications, track application status and
          access your travel documents — all in one place.
        </p>

        <div class="feature-list">
          <div class="feature-item">
            <span>✓</span>
            Easy Account Registration
          </div>

          <div class="feature-item">
            <span>✓</span>
            Track Your Visa Applications
          </div>

          <div class="feature-item">
            <span>✓</span>
            Manage Your Travel Documents
          </div>
        </div>

        <a href="/" class="home-button">
          Explore VisaMaster
          <span>→</span>
        </a>

        <div class="coming-soon-footer">
          Thank you for choosing VisaMaster.
          <strong>Your Trusted Visa Partner.</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
